   "nrr:method": "a species was treated as lacking a DFA if it had no DFA hit and also had more than 6,000 proteins in UniProt. chosen to maximise overlap between species with trait information and species with known DFA status, and to include biological features for which actin is relevant. 13 species whose DFA status varied across strains were removed after BLASTp and tBLASTn checks proved uninterpretable, possibly from undersampling or noisy assemblies. 28 further species removed for absence from TimeTree.",
